  "notes": "Population/households are final ENUMERATED counts (census moment 00:00 15 June 2022, incl. floating population), not PEC-adjusted. Unit lists and population per district/upazila/city corporation/thana/paurashava/union/ward from the Community Report Excel files, sheet C-01 (BBS 2022 geocodes; code_scheme BBS_GEOCODE_2022 = C-01 code columns joined with '-', prefixed by division 20). City-corporation units carry the city-corporation code in the geocode, so wards and mahallas of Chattogram City Corporation (20-15-16) and Cumilla City Corporation (20-19-50) are kept apart. Administrative-unit counts, area and density from the District Report Key Findings tables (District Series, June 2024) and Union Statistics (June 2025) Table D01. basis: enumerated | as stated (printed in a BBS table) | derived (counted from the C-01 geocode rows). Level 'cantonment' is used for Comilla Cantonment (Union/Ward column, code 998, under Adarsha Sadar); other cantonments appear only as village/mahalla rows named 'Cantonment' and are not separate units here. Rangamati, Khagrachhari and Bandarban are listed with the same unit types as other districts (upazila, paurashava, union, mauza, village); BBS gives no hill-district council or circle information. Large PDFs/Excel are not committed; fetch.py --division chattogram re-downloads them (bbs.gov.bd needs the Sectigo DV R36 intermediate, added at runtime from its AIA URL).",
